xnu 0418: prove the Wi-Fi apps-SMMU stage-1 walk

After W1 identifies QCA6490 with bus mastering off, program one apps-SMMU
context for SID/ASID 0x1c01 and install the exact stream route. If IDR0.ATOSNS
is clear, translate a wired canary with ATS1PR and require a deliberate miss to
return PAR.F; if ATOSNS is set, record W2 PARTIAL after context/route readback.
No endpoint DMA, MSI, MHI, firmware or network interface is started.

Register/table facts come from mainline arm-smmu/io-pgtable-arm (GPL-2.0,
facts only), ARM IHI 0062D.c, and the MIT ArmSmmu4K/PongWifi profile at
qiumochen/UniXNU-zizhan 88f4eeb. The guarded MMIO layer is 0417.

